msgstr "%s minn %s fajls tal-vidjo m'għandhom l-ebda kurva u l-ebda spazju tal-kulur fil-kaxxa colr%s -- probabbilment materjal log."

msgid "%r is a Timecode, but there is no picture here and so no camera to count it from. Then only a value from the window start works, such as +12:30."
msgstr "%r huwa timecode, iżda hawn m'hemmx stampa u għalhekk l-ebda kamera biex jingħadd minnha. Allura jaħdem biss valur mill-bidu tat-tieqa, bħal +12:30."

msgid "%r is a Timecode, but the time axis hangs on no clock: no file here carries one, the reference camera %s included. Then only a value from the window start works, such as +12:30."
msgstr "%r huwa timecode, iżda l-assi tal-ħin mhu marbut mal-ebda arloġġ: l-ebda fajl hawn m'għandu wieħed, inkluża l-kamera ta' referenza %s. Allura jaħdem biss valur mill-bidu tat-tieqa, bħal +12:30."

msgid "%r is not a Multitrack preset"
msgstr "%r mhuwiex preset Multitrack"

msgid "%r is not a number."
msgstr "%r mhuwiex numru."

msgid "%s\n   does not fit the other files: sound not recognised, no timecode.\n   %s"
msgstr "%s\n   ma jaqbilx mal-fajls l-oħra: il-ħoss ma ntgħarafx, l-ebda timecode.\n   %s"

msgid "Set to %s; %s is one click away."
msgstr "Issettjat għal %s; %s hu klikk wieħed 'il bogħod."

msgid "Left out, %s being taken already; %s is one click away."
msgstr "Imħolli barra, għax %s diġà meħuda; %s hu klikk wieħed 'il bogħod."

msgid "Its sound cannot be used."
msgstr "Il-ħoss tiegħu ma jistax jintuża."

msgid "%s\n   sound not recognised; placed by its timecode"
msgstr "%s\n   il-ħoss ma ntgħarafx; tqiegħed skont it-timecode tiegħu"

msgid "%s   --   the app does not know this format"
msgstr "%s   --   l-app ma tafx dan il-format"

msgid "%s  (%s)  --  %s  --  %s blocks"
msgstr "%s  (%s)  --  %s  --  blokki: %s"

msgid "%s -- what should happen with it?\nThe details are in the log."
msgstr "%s -- x'għandu jsir?\nId-dettalji jinsabu fil-log."

msgid "%s kHz instead of %s kHz -- converted during processing."
msgstr "%s kHz minflok %s kHz -- jiġi kkonvertit waqt l-ipproċessar."

msgid "%s cannot be placed: its sound has nothing in common with the rest of the material, and the file carries no timecode. It needs one that fits the other recordings, and that has to be set with another program."
msgstr "%s ma jistax jitqiegħed: il-ħoss tiegħu m'għandu xejn komuni mal-bqija tal-materjal, u l-fajl m'għandu l-ebda timecode. Jeħtieġ wieħed li jaqbel mar-reġistrazzjonijiet l-oħra, u dak irid jiġi ssettjat bi programm ieħor."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material and is far shorter than the rest: proposed as the intro, which is put at the front and never measured."
msgstr "Il-fajl %s ma jaqbel ma' xejn fil-materjal u huwa ferm iqsar mill-bqija: propost bħala d-daħla, li titqiegħed fil-bidu u qatt ma titkejjel."

msgid "%s is set, and nothing is adjusted here: the tracks leave as they were recorded, and the loudness is set where they are mixed."
msgstr "Issettjat: %s, u hawn ma jiġi aġġustat xejn: il-binarji joħorġu kif ġew irreġistrati, u l-qawwa tal-ħoss tiġi ssettjata fejn jitħalltu."

msgid "%s can be placed again and is back in the run."
msgstr "Il-fajl %s jista' jerġa' jitqiegħed u reġa' daħal fit-tħaddim."

msgid "%s could not be installed.\nBy hand:  %s -m pip install %s"
msgstr "L-installazzjoni ta' %s ma rnexxietx.\nBl-idejn:  %s -m pip install %s"

msgid "%s has no audio track."
msgstr "%s m'għandux binarju tal-awdjo."

msgid "%s in %s"
msgstr "%s f'%s"

msgid "%s in %s's microphone: %s dB quieter than in their own."
msgstr "%s fil-mikrofonu ta' %s: %s dB aktar baxx milli fil-mikrofonu proprju."

msgid "%s is in %s -- the file is now in the player."
msgstr "%s jinsab f'%s -- il-fajl issa jinsab fil-plejer."

msgid "%s is not on the axis of the episode: it is set in front of the material or after it, not cut into it. In point and Out point belong to what lies between."
msgstr "%s mhux fuq l-assi tal-ħin tal-episodju: jitqiegħed qabel il-materjal jew warajh, mhux maqtugħ ġo fih. Il-punt tad-dħul u l-punt tal-ħruġ jappartjenu għal dak li hemm bejniethom."

msgid "%s is in none of the video files. Is there a timecode that fits the material?"
msgstr "%s ma jinsab f'ebda fajl tal-vidjo. Hemm timecode li jaqbel mal-materjal?"

msgid "%s%s in %s's microphone only %s dB quieter"
msgstr "%s%s fil-mikrofonu ta' %s biss %s dB aktar baxx"

msgid "%s: not seekable yet, will follow (%s)"
msgstr "%s: għad ma jistax isir qbiż fih, jiġi wara (%s)"

msgid "%s: not there"
msgstr "%s: mhux hemm"

msgid "%s: setPosition(%s), attempt %d, then at %s"
msgstr "%s: setPosition(%s), tentattiv %d, imbagħad f'%s"

msgid "%s: should go to %s%s -- %s"
msgstr "%s: għandu jmur għal %s%s -- %s"

msgid ", no audio"
msgstr ", bla awdjo"

msgid "-- only one camera"
msgstr "-- kamera waħda biss"

msgid "--- jump to %s programme time%s ---"
msgstr "--- qabża għal %s tal-ħin tal-programm%s ---"

msgid "--- point set, programme time runs from %s ---"
msgstr "--- punt issettjat, il-ħin tal-programm jibda minn %s ---"

msgid "... or add files ..."
msgstr "... jew żid fajls ..."

msgid "/not seekable"
msgstr "/mingħajr qbiż"

msgid "<span style='color:%(t)s'><b>%(n)s shots</b>, median %(med)s s, shortest %(short)s s, longest camera %(long)s s</span>. Speech time: <b>%(own)s %%</b> on their own camera (%(own_t)s), %(wide)s %% on the wide shot (%(wide_t)s), <span style='color:%(warn)s'>at %(off)s %% (%(off_t)s) the speaker's camera is not active</span>"
msgstr "<span style='color:%(t)s'><b>Qatgħat: %(n)s</b>, medjan %(med)s s, l-iqsar %(short)s s, l-itwal kamera %(long)s s</span>. Ħin ta' taħdit: <b>%(own)s %%</b> fuq il-kamera tagħhom stess (%(own_t)s), %(wide)s %% fuq il-veduta wiesgħa (%(wide_t)s), <span style='color:%(warn)s'>f'%(off)s %% (%(off_t)s) il-kamera tal-kelliem mhix attiva</span>"

msgid "Every pair of channels is judged on its own: one stereo track, or two microphones and therefore two tracks. Silent inputs drop out. The rows under the file say what was measured, and the tick overrules it."
msgstr "Kull par ta' kanali jiġi ġġudikat għalih: binarju stereo wieħed, jew żewġ mikrofoni u għalhekk żewġ binarji. L-inputs siekta jitħallew barra. Ir-ringieli taħt il-fajl jgħidu x'ġie mkejjel, u l-marka tegħleb dan."

msgid "A negative value makes the picture lead the sound."
msgstr "Valur negattiv iġiegħel l-istampa tmur qabel il-ħoss."

msgid "Add files ..."
msgstr "Żid fajls ..."

msgid "Alignment goes by the measured offset; the timecode is only the cross-check."
msgstr "L-allinjament isir skont l-ispostament imkejjel; it-timecode huwa biss il-kontroll inkroċjat."

msgid "All recordings carry the same name -- that makes a single track."
msgstr "Ir-reġistrazzjonijiet kollha għandhom l-istess isem -- dan jagħmel binarju wieħed biss."

msgid "All rows carry the same name -- that makes a single track, and Multitrack needs at least two."
msgstr "Ir-ringieli kollha għandhom l-istess isem -- dan jagħmel binarju wieħed biss, u Multitrack jeħtieġ mill-inqas tnejn."

msgid "Assignment: which audio track belongs to which camera"
msgstr "Assenjazzjoni: liema binarju tal-awdjo jappartjeni għal liema kamera"

msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Awdjo"

msgid "Audio and video (%s);;All files (*)"
msgstr "Awdjo u vidjo (%s);;Il-fajls kollha (*)"

msgid "Audio at programme time"
msgstr "Awdjo fil-ħin tal-programm"

msgid "Auphonic created different tracks than requested: %s instead of %s"
msgstr "Auphonic ħoloq binarji differenti minn dawk mitluba: %s minflok %s"

msgid "Auphonic reports an error: %s"
msgstr "Auphonic jirrapporta żball: %s"

msgid "Bleed"
msgstr "Tnixxija"

msgid "Blocks"
msgstr "Blokki"

msgid "Both at once does not work: the returning tracks would go to one value, our own mix to the other. Either set --lufs %.0f or change the preset."
msgstr "It-tnejn flimkien ma jaħdmux: il-binarji li jirritornaw imorru għal valur wieħed, it-taħlita tagħna għall-ieħor. Jew issettja --lufs %.0f jew ibdel il-preset."

msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Kamera"

msgid "Camera audio, %s to go ..."
msgstr "Awdjo tal-kamera, fadal %s ..."

msgid "%s -- preview  (length %s)"
msgstr "%s -- dehra minn qabel  (tul %s)"

msgid "Why the run cannot start"
msgstr "Għaliex it-tħaddim ma jistax jibda"

msgid "Cannot start yet: %s"
msgstr "Għadu ma jistax jibda: %s"

msgid "Change rejected: %s"
msgstr "Bidla miċħuda: %s"

msgid "Check again"
msgstr "Iċċekkja mill-ġdid"

msgid "Check the connection to Resolve again"
msgstr "Iċċekkja mill-ġdid il-konnessjoni ma' Resolve"

msgid "Check itself failed: %s"
msgstr "Il-kontroll innifsu falla: %s"

msgid "Check the key and fetch Presets."
msgstr "Jiċċekkja ċ-ċavetta u jniżżel il-presets."

msgid "Chosen"
msgstr "Magħżul"

msgid "Clock %7.2f%s | B1[%s] %s | B2[%s] %s | Audio %s %s"
msgstr "Arloġġ %7.2f%s | B1[%s] %s | B2[%s] %s | Awdjo %s %s"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Agħlaq"

msgid "Connects to Resolve again."
msgstr "Jerġa' jikkonnettja ma' Resolve."

msgid "Content: a camera like any other.\nWide shot: a camera nobody sits in front of -- it takes no speaker, and the cut goes to it in a pause and in a long monologue.\nIntro and outro are finished clips -- not aligned, not processed, only placed in the Timeline.\nIgnore video: the file stays out entirely."
msgstr "Kontenut: kamera bħal kull oħra.\nVeduta wiesgħa: kamera li ħadd ma joqgħod quddiemha -- ma tieħu l-ebda kelliem, u l-muntaġġ imur għaliha f'pawża u f'monologu twil.\nId-daħla u l-għeluq huma klippjiet lesti -- mhux allinjati, mhux ipproċessati, imqiegħda biss fit-Timeline.\nInjora dan il-vidjo: il-fajl jibqa' barra għal kollox."

msgid "  %s wide shots: the cut uses %s."
msgstr "  Vedute wiesgħa: %s; il-muntaġġ juża %s."

msgid "  Every camera carries a speaker, so there is no wide shot: the four wide shot settings and the tick for the edges do nothing here."
msgstr "  Kull kamera għandha kelliem, għalhekk m'hemmx veduta wiesgħa: l-erba' għażliet tal-veduta wiesgħa u l-marka għat-truf ma jagħmlu xejn hawn."

msgid "No camera is free of speakers, so there is no wide shot: the four wide shot settings and the tick for the edges do nothing. Give a camera the Kind \"Wide shot\", or leave one without a speaker."
msgstr "L-ebda kamera mhi ħielsa minn kellimin, għalhekk m'hemmx veduta wiesgħa: l-erba' għażliet tal-veduta wiesgħa u l-marka għat-truf ma jagħmlu xejn. Agħti lil kamera fil-qasam Tip \"Veduta wiesgħa\", jew ħalli waħda mingħajr kelliem."

msgid "placed by phase, sharpness %s against a floor of %s, drift unknown"
msgstr "imqiegħed skont il-fażi, nitidezza %s kontra livell minimu ta' %s, drift mhux magħruf"

msgid "placed on the bands that move"
msgstr "imqiegħed skont il-meded tal-frekwenza li jiċċaqilqu"

msgid "Why the wide shot settings are grey"
msgstr "Għaliex l-għażliet tal-veduta wiesgħa huma griżi"

msgid "because no speaker is assigned to it"
msgstr "għax l-ebda kelliem mhu assenjat lilha"

msgid "marked as the wide shot -- it takes no speakers"
msgstr "immarkata bħala l-veduta wiesgħa -- ma tieħu l-ebda kelliem"

msgid "no speaker is assigned to it, but the cut uses %s"
msgstr "l-ebda kelliem mhu assenjat lilha, iżda l-muntaġġ juża %s"

msgid "the cut uses %s"
msgstr "il-muntaġġ juża %s"

msgid "Curve and colour space are missing from the file"
msgstr "Il-kurva u l-ispazju tal-kulur neqsin mill-fajl"

msgid "In point and Out point are available once the time axis is set -- from the timecode or measured."
msgstr "Il-punt tad-dħul u l-punt tal-ħruġ ikunu disponibbli ladarba l-assi tal-ħin ikun stabbilit -- mit-timecode jew imkejjel."

msgid "In point is %s before the first frame"
msgstr "Il-punt tad-dħul huwa %s qabel l-ewwel qafas"

msgid "In point is now %s, but the existing files belong to %s.\n  The audio in the videos is cut to the old window -- press Start\n  above again."
msgstr "Il-punt tad-dħul issa huwa %s, iżda l-fajls eżistenti jappartjenu għal %s.\n  L-awdjo fil-vidjos huwa maqtugħ għat-tieqa l-qadima -- erġa' agħfas \"Ibda\"\n  hawn fuq."

msgid "Out point is %s after the last frame"
msgstr "Il-punt tal-ħruġ huwa %s wara l-aħħar qafas"

msgid "Out point is now %s; the window would be %s long, the existing\n  files are %s -- press Start above again."
msgstr "Il-punt tal-ħruġ issa huwa %s; it-tieqa tkun twila %s, il-fajls\n  eżistenti huma %s -- erġa' agħfas \"Ibda\" hawn fuq."

msgid "Delivery usually takes the limited range. Full is not wrong, but some players misread it."
msgstr "Għat-twassil normalment tintuża l-firxa limitata. Dik sħiħa mhix ħażina, iżda xi plejers jaqrawha ħażin."

msgid "Determines how auphonic.com processes the audio.\n\n\"%s\" leaves the key in place and still does not go there.\nThe audio is then only merged and normalised, not unmixed --\nand without separate tracks there is no camera cut."
msgstr "Jiddetermina kif auphonic.com jipproċessa l-awdjo.\n\n\"%s\" iħalli ċ-ċavetta f'postha u xorta ma jmurx hemm.\nL-awdjo mbagħad jingħaqad u jiġi normalizzat biss, mhux separat --\nu mingħajr binarji separati m'hemmx muntaġġ tal-kameras."

msgid "Distance to mean"
msgstr "Distanza mill-medja"

msgid "Drag audio and video files here"
msgstr "Kaxkar fajls tal-awdjo u tal-vidjo hawn"

msgid "Dry run: only measuring, nothing written, nothing uploaded."
msgstr "Tħaddim ta' prova: kejl biss, xejn ma jinkiteb, xejn ma jitla'."

msgid "During greeting and farewell the picture stays wide."
msgstr "Waqt it-tislima tal-bidu u tal-aħħar l-istampa tibqa' wiesgħa."

msgid "The frames stand a little longer; the file is not any shorter for it. Editing software repeats about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "L-oqfsa jdumu ftit aktar; il-fajl ma jsirx iqsar minħabba f'hekk. Is-softwer tal-editjar jirrepeti madwar qafas wieħed kull %s s, u l-istampa u l-awdjo tal-kamera jibqgħu flimkien."

msgid "The frames stand a little shorter; the file is not any longer for it. Editing software leaves out about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "L-oqfsa jdumu ftit inqas; il-fajl ma jsirx itwal minħabba f'hekk. Is-softwer tal-editjar iħalli barra madwar qafas wieħed kull %s s, u l-istampa u l-awdjo tal-kamera jibqgħu flimkien."

msgid "Eight bits are not enough for HDR: every gradient bands, and YouTube requires ten or twelve."
msgstr "Tmien bits mhumiex biżżejjed għall-HDR: f'kull gradjent jidhru strixxi, u YouTube jeħtieġ għaxra jew tnax."

msgid "Envelope"
msgstr "Inviluppu"

msgid "  %s is placed on %s, which is no camera of this run -- the cut names it all the same."
msgstr "  Il-kelliem %s jinsab fuq %s, li mhix kamera ta' dan it-tħaddim -- il-muntaġġ isemmiha xorta waħda."

msgid "Envelope failed: %s"
msgstr "L-inviluppu falla: %s"

msgid "Envelopes and camera audio are prepared in the background."
msgstr "L-inviluppi u l-awdjo tal-kameras jiġu ppreparati fl-isfond."

msgid "Every row needs a name -- at Auphonic it becomes the track ID."
msgstr "Kull ringiela teħtieġ isem -- f'Auphonic isir it-track ID."

msgid "External preview -- the app does not know this format"
msgstr "Dehra minn qabel esterna -- l-app ma tafx dan il-format"

msgid "Fetching audio"
msgstr "Ġbid tal-awdjo"

msgid "Fetching audio ..."
msgstr "Ġbid tal-awdjo ..."

msgid "File"
msgstr "Fajl"

msgid "Files are missing there -- without a new upload nothing can be computed.\n  With --auphonic-resume upload the script uploads again; this costs credit."
msgstr "Hemmhekk jonqsu fajls -- mingħajr tlugħ ġdid ma jista' jiġi kkalkulat xejn.\n  B'--auphonic-resume upload l-iskript itella' mill-ġdid; dan jiswa kreditu."

msgid "For HDR the usual choice is HEVC (Main 10), AV1 or VP9 Profile 2. YouTube takes H.264 too, but it needs more bitrate."
msgstr "Għall-HDR l-għażla tas-soltu hija HEVC (Main 10), AV1 jew VP9 Profile 2. YouTube jaċċetta wkoll H.264, iżda dan jeħtieġ bitrate ogħla."

msgid "For ten bits HEVC needs the Main 10 profile. In Resolve it sits under Deliver as \"Profile\"."
msgstr "Għal għaxar bits HEVC jeħtieġ il-profil Main 10. F'Resolve jinsab taħt Deliver bħala \"Profile\"."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s fewer frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps, mhux il-%s tal-fajl -- inqas oqfsa (%s) fl-istess tul."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s more frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps, mhux il-%s tal-fajl -- aktar oqfsa (%s) fl-istess tul."

msgid "Frame spacing varies by %s %% -- the frame timing is uneven."
msgstr "L-ispazju bejn l-oqfsa jvarja b'%s %% -- il-ħin tal-oqfsa mhux uniformi."

msgid "Free space there: %s"
msgstr "Spazju ħieles hemmhekk: %s"

msgid "Gap of %s between block %d and %d -- the camera stopped."
msgstr "Vojt ta' %s bejn il-blokk %d u %d -- il-kamera waqfet."

msgid "Drag to move the position."
msgstr "Kaxkar biex iċċaqlaq il-pożizzjoni."

msgid "HDR needs 16 here (PQ, that is HDR10) or 18 (HLG). In Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 or HLG. 14 is not an HDR curve but SDR in the BT.2020 space."
msgstr "Għall-HDR hawn irid ikun hemm 16 (PQ, jiġifieri HDR10) jew 18 (HLG). F'Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 jew HLG. 14 mhix kurva HDR iżda SDR fl-ispazju BT.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020). In Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."
msgstr "Għall-HDR hawn irid ikun hemm 9 (BT.2020). F'Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020, non-constant luminance)."
msgstr "Għall-HDR hawn irid ikun hemm 9 (BT.2020, luminanza mhux kostanti)."

msgid "HLG is display-referred -- it has no entry for the mastering display."
msgstr "L-HLG huwa marbut mal-iskrin -- m'għandux entrata għall-iskrin tal-mastering."

msgid "If empty: next to each video file."
msgstr "Jekk vojt: ħdejn kull fajl tal-vidjo."

msgid "It arose during the recording and cannot be changed now. The less the microphones are separated, the more cautiously De-Bleed at auphonic.com can work. Next time: three times as far from the neighbouring microphone as from your own mouth, then the neighbouring voice sits about %s dB lower."
msgstr "Inħolqot waqt ir-reġistrazzjoni u issa ma tistax tinbidel. Inqas ma l-mikrofoni jkunu separati, aktar De-Bleed fuq auphonic.com irid jaħdem b'kawtela. Id-darba li jmiss: tliet darbiet aktar 'il bogħod mill-mikrofonu ta' ħdejk milli minn ħalqek, u mbagħad il-leħen ta' ħdejk ikun madwar %s dB aktar baxx."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material, so it cannot be cut into the episode: set to Intro."
msgstr "Il-fajl %s ma jaqbel ma' xejn fil-materjal, għalhekk ma jistax jiddaħħal fl-episodju: issettjat bħala Daħla."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material either, and the intro is taken: left out."
msgstr "Il-fajl %s lanqas ma jaqbel ma' xejn fil-materjal, u d-daħla diġà meħuda: imħolli barra."

msgid "%s is already set as %s, and an episode has one of those. Answer differently here, or take the mark off that file first."
msgstr "Il-fajl %s diġà ssettjat bħala %s, u episodju jkollu wieħed biss minn dan it-tip. Wieġeb b'mod ieħor hawn, jew l-ewwel neħħi l-marka minn dak il-fajl."

msgid "It is in the logs atom of the picture description -- that is how Resolve recognises the input colour space. Different curves mean different input colour spaces."
msgstr "Dan jinsab fl-atom logs tad-deskrizzjoni tal-istampa -- hekk Resolve jagħraf l-ispazju tal-kulur tad-dħul. Kurvi differenti jfissru spazji tal-kulur tad-dħul differenti."

msgid "Jumps to the end of the window."
msgstr "Jaqbeż għat-tmiem tat-tieqa."

msgid "Jumps to the start of the window."
msgstr "Jaqbeż għall-bidu tat-tieqa."

msgid "Keychain"
msgstr "Keychain"

msgid "Limits the de-bleed: "
msgstr "Jillimita De-Bleed: "

msgid "Load Presets and pick one, or leave the API Key empty."
msgstr "Niżżel il-presets u agħżel wieħed, jew ħalli ċ-ċavetta tal-API vojta."

msgid "Main10 rejected -- the default stays"
msgstr "Main10 miċħud -- jibqa' l-issettjar standard"

msgid "Measure only -- nothing is written or uploaded."
msgstr "Kejl biss -- xejn ma jinkiteb jew jittella'."

msgid "Measuring %s (%s of %s)"
msgstr "Kejl: %s (%s minn %s)"

msgid "Measuring not possible: %s"
msgstr "Il-kejl mhux possibbli: %s"

msgid "Measuring the yardstick"
msgstr "Kejl tar-referenza"

msgid "Measuring time axis ..."
msgstr "Qed jitkejjel l-assi tal-ħin ..."

msgid "Missing audio %s filled with silence%s"
msgstr "L-awdjo nieqes %s imtela bis-silenzju%s"

msgid "Module DaVinciResolveScript cannot be loaded: %s"
msgstr "Il-modulu DaVinciResolveScript ma jistax jitgħabba: %s"

msgid "One audio track per person, kept apart all the way to auphonic.com.\nWorks without it as well -- then without de-bleed and leveler.\nIt needs two input tracks: a recording of its own, a channel of a\nmultichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use\nthe audio\". The camera cut does not need this tick."
msgstr "Binarju tal-awdjo wieħed għal kull persuna, separat sa auphonic.com.\nJaħdem ukoll mingħajru -- imbagħad mingħajr De-Bleed u Leveler.\nJeħtieġ żewġ binarji tad-dħul: reġistrazzjoni għaliha, kanal ta' reġistratur\nb'ħafna kanali, jew l-awdjo ta' fajl tal-vidjo ssettjat fuq \"uża l-awdjo intern\".\nIl-muntaġġ tal-kameras ma jeħtieġx din il-marka."

msgid "Multitrack (one track per speaker)"
msgstr "Multitrack (binarju għal kull kelliem)"

msgid "Multitrack needs at least two input tracks. A track is a recording of its own, a channel of a multichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use internal audio\". Several blocks of the same recording count as one, tracks set aside not at all."
msgstr "Multitrack jeħtieġ mill-inqas żewġ binarji tad-dħul. Binarju huwa reġistrazzjoni għaliha, kanal ta' reġistratur b'ħafna kanali, jew l-awdjo ta' fajl tal-vidjo ssettjat fuq \"uża l-awdjo intern\". Diversi blokki tal-istess reġistrazzjoni jgħoddu bħala wieħed, binarji mwarrba ma jgħoddu xejn."

msgid "No API key. Pass --auphonic-api-key KEY, set AUPHONIC_TOKEN or have it remembered once in the interface. The key is in the Auphonic account settings."
msgstr "L-ebda ċavetta tal-API. Għaddi --auphonic-api-key KEY, issettja AUPHONIC_TOKEN jew ħalli l-interfaċċa tiftakarha darba. Iċ-ċavetta tinsab fl-issettjar tal-kont ta' Auphonic."

msgid "No audio file carries a timecode. In point and Out point count from the start of the material -- the position of the files to each other is measured."
msgstr "L-ebda fajl tal-awdjo m'għandu timecode. Il-punt tad-dħul u l-punt tal-ħruġ jgħoddu mill-bidu tal-materjal -- il-pożizzjoni tal-fajls bejniethom hija mkejla."

msgid "No sound in use yet -- add an audio recording, or set a video file's Camera audio to \"use internal audio\" in the file list."
msgstr "L-ebda ħoss għadu ma qed jintuża -- żid reġistrazzjoni tal-awdjo, jew fil-lista tal-fajls issettja l-Awdjo tal-kamera ta' fajl tal-vidjo fuq \"uża l-awdjo intern\"."

msgid "No audio tracks are assigned."
msgstr "L-ebda binarju tal-awdjo mhu assenjat."

msgid "No camera is assigned, so there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "L-ebda kamera mhi assenjata, għalhekk m'hemm xejn bejn xiex taqta'."

msgid "No cameras assigned yet -- switch Multitrack on to do that."
msgstr "L-ebda kamera għadha mhi assenjata -- biex tagħmel dan, ixgħel Multitrack."

msgid "No connection to Resolve.\n  Is the program running? Is external scripting set to 'Local'\n  under Preferences > System > General?"
msgstr "L-ebda konnessjoni ma' Resolve.\n  Il-programm qed jaħdem? L-iskriptjar estern huwa ssettjat fuq 'Local'\n  taħt Preferences > System > General?"

msgid "No files or project opened yet."
msgstr "L-ebda fajl jew proġett għadu ma nfetaħ."

msgid "No files selected yet."
msgstr "L-ebda fajl għadu ma ntgħażel."

msgid "No input possible. Use %s %s to set what should happen."
msgstr "L-ebda input possibbli. Uża %s %s biex tissettja x'għandu jiġri."

msgid "No player is built in here -- playback runs in ffplay in its own window."
msgstr "M'hemmx plejer mibni hawn -- id-daqq isir f'ffplay fit-tieqa tiegħu stess."

msgid "No preset given, no input possible. Choose one of the above with --auphonic-preset NAME."
msgstr "L-ebda preset mogħti, l-ebda input possibbli. Agħżel wieħed minn ta' hawn fuq b'--auphonic-preset NAME."

msgid "No presets stored in the account. One can be created in the web interface."
msgstr "M'hemm l-ebda preset maħżun fil-kont. Tista' toħloq wieħed fl-interfaċċa tal-web."

msgid "No speaker is known here -- without who speaks when there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "L-ebda kelliem mhu magħruf hawn -- mingħajr min jitkellem meta, m'hemm xejn bejn xiex taqta'."

msgid "No voice has a camera yet -- with that every shot would be the same one."
msgstr "L-ebda leħen għad m'għandu kamera -- b'hekk kull qatgħa tkun l-istess waħda."

msgid "No speakers known yet -- nothing measured, nothing separated, and no handover file of an earlier run in %s or its subfolders."
msgstr "L-ebda kelliem għadu magħruf -- xejn imkejjel, xejn separat, u l-ebda fajl tal-konsenja minn tħaddim preċedenti fil-folder %s jew fis-sottofolders tiegħu."

msgid "Not found again after import: %s"
msgstr "Ma nstabx mill-ġdid wara l-importazzjoni: %s"

msgid "from ffmpeg.org, and the folder into PATH"
msgstr "minn ffmpeg.org, u l-folder fil-PATH"

msgid "over the package manager: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"
msgstr "permezz tal-maniġer tal-pakketti: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"

msgid "Here: %s. Needed: %s or newer."
msgstr "Hawn: %s. Meħtieġa: %s jew aktar ġdida."

msgid "no answer"
msgstr "l-ebda tweġiba"

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right."
msgstr "Xejn ma jaħdem sakemm dan ma jissewwiex."

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right. This way: %s"
msgstr "Xejn ma jaħdem sakemm dan ma jissewwiex. Hekk: %s"

msgid "Get it: %s"
msgstr "Ġibu: %s"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Oħroġ"

msgid "That worked."
msgstr "Irnexxa."

msgid "Installing ffmpeg"
msgstr "Installazzjoni ta' ffmpeg"

msgid "Start the program again to pick it up."
msgstr "Erġa' ibda l-programm biex jintebaħ bih."

msgid "Getting it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "It-tniżżil jieħu ftit minuti, u dak li jgħid jidher taħt \"Ħruġ\"."

msgid "This takes a few minutes -- a package manager may build from source. What it says appears here."
msgstr "Dan jieħu ftit minuti -- maniġer tal-pakketti jista' jibni mis-sors. Dak li jgħid jidher hawn."

msgid "Now it is being compiled, and that is the long part: minutes on a fast machine and a good deal longer on an older one. Nothing is stuck -- a dot appears every few seconds for as long as it works."
msgstr "Issa qed jiġi kkompilat, u din hija l-parti twila: minuti fuq kompjuter mgħaġġel u ħafna aktar fuq wieħed eqdem. Xejn mhu mwaħħal -- tidher tikka kull ftit sekondi sakemm ikun qed jaħdem."

msgid "ffmpeg is in place."
msgstr "ffmpeg jinsab f'postu."

msgid "The program reads it when it starts. It can start again now, or you can do that yourself later."
msgstr "Il-programm jaqrah meta jibda. Jista' jerġa' jibda issa, jew tista' tagħmel dan int aktar tard."

msgid "Start again now"
msgstr "Erġa' ibda issa"

msgid "Starting again did not work. Close the window and start the program the way you did before."
msgstr "Il-bidu mill-ġdid ma rnexxiex. Agħlaq it-tieqa u ibda l-programm kif għamilt qabel."

msgid "  Taking the ffmpeg that is there out of the way first: %s"
msgstr "  L-ewwel qed jitwarrab il-ffmpeg li hemm: %s"

msgid "  A built ffmpeg 9.0.1 with soxr can be fetched: %s"
msgstr "  Jista' jitniżżel ffmpeg 9.0.1 lest b'soxr: %s"

msgid "  Fetch it now? [Y/n] "
msgstr "  Niżżlu issa? [Y/n] "

msgid "  Fetching a built ffmpeg. It is a big one, so this takes a few minutes: %s"
msgstr "  Qed jitniżżel ffmpeg lest. Huwa kbir, għalhekk dan jieħu ftit minuti: %s"

msgid "  %s of %s MB"
msgstr "  %s minn %s MB"

msgid "The build could not be fetched: %s"
msgstr "Il-verżjoni lesta ma setgħetx titniżżel: %s"

msgid "  The build could not be unpacked: %s"
msgstr "  Il-verżjoni lesta ma setgħetx tiġi estratta: %s"

msgid "  The archive held %s of the two programs."
msgstr "  L-arkivju kien fih %s miż-żewġ programmi."

msgid "  It is here: %s"
msgstr "  Jinsab hawn: %s"

msgid "install Homebrew from brew.sh, then this again"
msgstr "installa Homebrew minn brew.sh, imbagħad erġa' agħmel dan"

msgid "This ffmpeg has soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 0.21 ppm."
msgstr "Dan il-ffmpeg għandu soxr: id-drift tal-arloġġ bejn il-kameras jiġi kkoreġut f'passi ta' 0.21 ppm."

msgid "This ffmpeg has no soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 21 ppm instead of 0.21."
msgstr "Dan il-ffmpeg m'għandux soxr: id-drift tal-arloġġ bejn il-kameras jiġi kkoreġut f'passi ta' 21 ppm minflok 0.21."

msgid "Everything works without it. Getting a build that has it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "Kollox jaħdem anki mingħajru. It-tniżżil ta' verżjoni li għandha jieħu ftit minuti, u dak li jgħid jidher taħt \"Ħruġ\"."

msgid "Carry on"
msgstr "Kompli"

msgid "Not mandatory -- YouTube then applies default values (Sony BVM-X300). To get them: in Resolve switch on HDR10+ under Color Management, run \"Analyze All Shots\" on the Color page and tick \"Embed HDR10 Metadata\" when rendering."
msgstr "Mhux obbligatorju -- imbagħad YouTube japplika valuri standard (Sony BVM-X300). Biex tiksibhom: f'Resolve ixgħel HDR10+ taħt Color Management, ħaddem \"Analyze All Shots\" fil-paġna Color u mmarka \"Embed HDR10 Metadata\" meta tirrendja."

msgid "Not ready yet:"
msgstr "Għadu mhux lest:"

msgid "Nothing was audible in the tracks."
msgstr "Ma kien jinstema' xejn fil-binarji."

msgid "One audio recording has no speaker name yet."
msgstr "Reġistrazzjoni tal-awdjo waħda għad m'għandhiex isem ta' kelliem."

msgid "One frame back."
msgstr "Qafas wieħed lura."

msgid "One second back."
msgstr "Sekonda waħda lura."

msgid "Each shot in the colour of its camera. Hover for camera and duration, click to jump."
msgstr "Kull qatgħa bil-kulur tal-kamera tagħha. Għaddi l-maws minn fuqha għall-kamera u t-tul, ikklikkja biex taqbeż."

msgid "Only one speaker"
msgstr "Kelliem wieħed biss"

msgid "Open json project file"
msgstr "Iftaħ fajl tal-proġett json"

msgid "Open result folder"
msgstr "Iftaħ il-folder tar-riżultat"

msgid "Open the settings, where the key is."
msgstr "Iftaħ l-issettjar, fejn tinsab iċ-ċavetta."

msgid "Order does not matter. For a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "L-ordni ma jimpurtax. Għal reġistrazzjoni f'diversi partijiet, l-ewwel blokk huwa biżżejjed."

msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "Ikteb fuqu"

msgid "Overwrite files"
msgstr "Ikteb fuq il-fajls"

msgid "Pane %d loads %s (%s)"
msgstr "Il-pannell %d qed jgħabbi %s (%s)"

msgid "Pane %d on %s"
msgstr "Il-pannell %d għal %s"

msgid "Play and pause -- the space bar works too."
msgstr "Daqq u pawża -- il-buttuna tal-ispazju taħdem ukoll."

msgid "Play and pause."
msgstr "Daqq u pawża."

msgid "Playback not possible"
msgstr "Id-daqq mhux possibbli"

msgid "Playing %s -- the processed track from auphonic.com,\nbrought to broadcast level. The same audio as in the camera cut."
msgstr "Qed jindaqq: %s -- il-binarju pproċessat minn auphonic.com,\nmiġjub għal-livell tax-xandir. L-istess awdjo bħal fil-muntaġġ tal-kameras."

msgid "Playing %s -- the raw recording.\nIt is much quieter than the processed audio; once the tracks from auphonic.com\nare there, the preview takes those."
msgstr "Qed jindaqq: %s -- ir-reġistrazzjoni mhux ipproċessata.\nHija ħafna aktar baxxa mill-awdjo pproċessat; ladarba l-binarji minn auphonic.com\njkunu hawn, id-dehra minn qabel tuża lilhom."

msgid "Possible reasons:\n  1. Resolve is not running -- the interface answers only while the program runs.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: external scripting is set to \"None\" instead of \"Local\".\n  3. Free edition: external scripting is reported to be reserved for the Studio edition since version 19.1. I found no official statement -- this check measures it instead of claiming it."
msgstr "Raġunijiet possibbli:\n  1. Resolve mhux qed jaħdem -- l-interfaċċa twieġeb biss waqt li l-programm ikun qed jaħdem.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: l-iskriptjar estern huwa ssettjat fuq \"None\" minflok \"Local\".\n  3. Edizzjoni b'xejn: jingħad li mill-verżjoni 19.1 l-iskriptjar estern huwa riżervat għall-edizzjoni Studio. Ma sibt l-ebda stqarrija uffiċjali -- dan il-kontroll ikejjel minflok ma jiddikjara."

msgid "Prepare pane %d for %s"
msgstr "Ipprepara l-pannell %d għal %s"

msgid "Preset not readable: %s"
msgstr "Il-preset ma jistax jinqara: %s"

msgid "Preview not possible: %s"
msgstr "Id-dehra minn qabel mhix possibbli: %s"

msgid "Preview running ..."
msgstr "Id-dehra minn qabel qed taħdem ..."

msgid "Prework -- read audio and compute envelopes:\n"
msgstr "Xogħol preliminari -- qari tal-awdjo u kalkolu tal-inviluppi:\n"

msgid "Primaries"
msgstr "Kuluri primarji"

msgid "Primaries number %d"
msgstr "Kuluri primarji numru %d"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com (optional)"
msgstr "Ipproċessar fuq auphonic.com (fakultattiv)"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com with \"%s\""
msgstr "Ipproċessar fuq auphonic.com bil-preset \"%s\""

msgid "Production finished, but no ZIP with the individual tracks"
msgstr "Il-produzzjoni lesta, iżda l-ebda ZIP bil-binarji individwali"

msgid "Production name"
msgstr "Isem il-produzzjoni"

msgid "Chosen files"
msgstr "Fajls magħżula"

msgid "Remove the chosen file from the list"
msgstr "Neħħi l-fajl magħżul mil-lista"

msgid "Project %r could not be created."
msgstr "Il-proġett %r ma setax jinħoloq."

msgid "Project %r could not be created. Is the name already in another folder?"
msgstr "Il-proġett %r ma setax jinħoloq. L-isem diġà jinsab f'folder ieħor?"

msgid "Project %r could not be opened."
msgstr "Il-proġett %r ma setax jinfetaħ."

msgid "Puts it back next to each video file."
msgstr "Jerġa' jqiegħdu ħdejn kull fajl tal-vidjo."

msgid "ROLLBACK FAILED (%s)"
msgstr "IT-TREĠGĦIJA LURA FALLIET (%s)"

msgid "Reading audio track from %s"
msgstr "Qed jinqara l-binarju tal-awdjo minn %s"

msgid "Resolutions"
msgstr "Riżoluzzjonijiet"

msgid "Resolve running ..."
msgstr "Resolve qed jaħdem ..."

msgid "Resolve scales to the Timeline resolution. Anything smaller is scaled up and gets softer."
msgstr "Resolve jiskala għar-riżoluzzjoni tat-Timeline. Kull ħaġa iżgħar titkabbar u ssir irtab."

msgid "Response was not JSON: %s"
msgstr "It-tweġiba ma kinitx JSON: %s"

msgid "Rows marked red show where the problem is; a tick on the tab means everything is there."
msgstr "Ir-ringieli mmarkati bl-aħmar juru fejn hi l-problema; marka fuq it-tab tfisser li kollox hemm."

msgid "Save in Keychain"
msgstr "Issejvja f'Keychain"

msgid "Save in Registry"
msgstr "Issejvja fir-reġistru"

msgid "Select audio and video files"
msgstr "Agħżel fajls tal-awdjo u tal-vidjo"

msgid "Speakers, as the run measured them"
msgstr "Kellimin, kif kejjilhom it-tħaddim"

msgid "Speakers, self-measured from the tracks"
msgstr "Kellimin, imkejla hawn mill-binarji nfushom"

msgid "Started late or stopped early -- this voice is then missing from the mix in places."
msgstr "Ir-reġistrazzjoni bdiet tard jew waqfet kmieni -- imbagħad dan il-leħen jonqos f'xi partijiet mit-taħlita."

msgid "Stopped. Choose another production name -- then a new production\n  is created -- or pick one of the other options."
msgstr "Twaqqaf. Agħżel isem ieħor għall-produzzjoni -- imbagħad tinħoloq produzzjoni\n  ġdida -- jew agħżel waħda mill-għażliet l-oħra."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was created."
msgstr "Twaqqaf. Ma nħoloq xejn."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was uploaded and nothing computed."
msgstr "Twaqqaf. Ma ttella' xejn u ma ġie kkalkulat xejn."

msgid "Used as it stands -- nothing is invented. Check in Resolve under Clip Attributes, tab Color Space: if it says \"Project\" there, the input colour space was not recognised and has to be set by hand."
msgstr "Jintuża kif inhu -- xejn ma jiġi invintat. Iċċekkja f'Resolve taħt Clip Attributes, tab Color Space: jekk hemm jgħid \"Project\", l-ispazju tal-kulur tad-dħul ma ntgħarafx u jrid jiġi ssettjat bl-idejn."

msgid "Takes the position from the picture."
msgstr "Jieħu l-pożizzjoni mill-istampa."

msgid "Ten seconds back."
msgstr "Għaxar sekondi lura."

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where I expect it:\n  %s\n  %s"
msgstr "L-interfaċċa ta' Resolve mhix fejn nistennieha:\n  %s\n  %s"

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where it should be."
msgstr "L-interfaċċa ta' Resolve mhix fejn suppost tkun."

msgid "The Timeline gets one fixed rate -- the highest of them, or the next rate Resolve has above it. It converts the others; with 23.976 against 24 that is where its audio analysis tends to stall."
msgstr "It-Timeline tieħu rata fissa waħda -- l-ogħla fosthom, jew ir-rata li jmiss 'il fuq minnha li għandu Resolve. Il-bqija jikkonvertihom hu; b'23.976 kontra 24, hemmhekk l-analiżi tal-awdjo tiegħu għandha t-tendenza teħel."

msgid "The audio recording of every speaker, plus the cameras.\nThe order does not matter -- the program recognises what is what.\nFor a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "Ir-reġistrazzjoni tal-awdjo ta' kull kelliem, flimkien mal-kameras.\nL-ordni ma jimpurtax -- il-programm jagħraf x'inhu xiex.\nGħal reġistrazzjoni f'diversi partijiet, l-ewwel blokk huwa biżżejjed."

msgid "The cut has no picture there. When the Timeline is built the spot stays empty, the audio runs on."
msgstr "Il-muntaġġ m'għandux stampa hemmhekk. Meta tinbena t-Timeline, dak il-post jibqa' vojt, l-awdjo jkompli."

msgid "The existing result is unusable: %s is missing there. With --auphonic-resume rerun it can be recomputed without uploading anything."
msgstr "Ir-riżultat eżistenti ma jistax jintuża: hemm nieqes %s. B'--auphonic-resume rerun jista' jerġa' jiġi kkalkulat mingħajr ma jittella' xejn."

msgid "The cut rules leave no shot standing in these %s. A shorter shortest shot, or less wide shot, gives one again."
msgstr "Ir-regoli tal-muntaġġ ma jħallu l-ebda qatgħa f'dan iż-żmien (%s). Tul minimu tal-qatgħa iqsar, jew inqas veduta wiesgħa, jerġa' jagħti waħda."

msgid "The programme is %s long here -- nothing can be laid out in that. In point and Out point are what set it."
msgstr "Il-programm hawn huwa twil %s -- xejn ma jista' jitqiegħed fih. Il-punt tad-dħul u l-punt tal-ħruġ huma li jiddeterminawh."

msgid "The time window lies outside the material: In point at %s, Out point at %s, and the material runs %s."
msgstr "It-tieqa tal-ħin tinsab barra l-materjal: punt tad-dħul f'%s, punt tal-ħruġ f'%s, u l-materjal idum %s."

msgid "The first preset track sets the settings for all our tracks. Otherwise they come back unprocessed. Create a track in the preset in the web interface."
msgstr "L-ewwel binarju tal-preset jissettja l-issettjar għall-binarji kollha tagħna. Inkella jiġu lura mhux ipproċessati. Oħloq binarju fil-preset fl-interfaċċa tal-web."

msgid "That needs the handover file from a run, and there is none."
msgstr "Għal dan hemm bżonn il-fajl tal-konsenja minn tħaddim, u m'hemmx."

msgid "The key can only be stored on Mac and Windows -- in the keychain or the registry. It does not go into a file."
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta tista' tinħażen biss fuq Mac u Windows -- f'Keychain jew fir-reġistru. Ma tmurx f'fajl."

msgid "%s -- being checked"
msgstr "%s -- qed jiġi ċċekkjat"

msgid "The key was not saved: %s"
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta ma ġietx issejvjata: %s"

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and try again."
msgstr "Keychain huwa msakkar. Iftħu u erġa' pprova."

msgid "This run is a test run and the store still carries its real name, so nothing was written. Point KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT or REG_PATH somewhere else first."
msgstr "Dan it-tħaddim huwa test u l-ħażna għadha ġġorr isimha l-veru, għalhekk ma nkiteb xejn. L-ewwel ipponta KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT jew REG_PATH x'imkien ieħor."

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and this button wakes up."
msgstr "Keychain huwa msakkar. Iftħu u din il-buttuna ssir attiva."

msgid "The keychain did not take the key. Keychain Access can say why."
msgstr "Keychain ma aċċettax iċ-ċavetta. Keychain Access jista' jgħidlek għaliex."

msgid "The registry did not take the key."
msgstr "Ir-reġistru ma aċċettax iċ-ċavetta."

msgid "Open Keychain Access"
msgstr "Iftaħ Keychain Access"

msgid "Opens the app that unlocks the keychain."
msgstr "Jiftaħ l-applikazzjoni li tneħħi s-serratura minn Keychain."

msgid "  Keychain Access could not be opened: %s"
msgstr "  Keychain Access ma setax jinfetaħ: %s"

msgid "The stored key is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta maħżuna mhix aċċettata: %s"

msgid "The key from AUPHONIC_TOKEN is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta minn AUPHONIC_TOKEN mhix aċċettata: %s"

msgid "What auphonic.com replied"
msgstr "X'wieġeb auphonic.com"

msgid "There is no key."
msgstr "M'hemmx ċavetta."

msgid "The key has a space or a line break at one end."
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta għandha spazju jew qabża ta' linja f'wieħed mit-truf."

msgid "The key is broken in the middle by a space or a line break."
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta hija maqsuma fin-nofs bi spazju jew qabża ta' linja."

msgid "The key has a character in it that cannot be typed."
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta fiha karattru li ma jistax jiġi ttajpjat."

msgid "The key is then in the %s, never in a file."
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta mbagħad tkun hawn: %s -- qatt f'fajl."

msgid "The production has no name yet."
msgstr "Il-produzzjoni għad m'għandhiex isem."

msgid "The recording assigned to this camera instead of the camera audio."
msgstr "Ir-reġistrazzjoni assenjata lil din il-kamera minflok l-awdjo tal-kamera."

msgid "The run is still going."
msgstr "It-tħaddim għadu għaddej."

msgid "No speakers are known yet -- they are worked out of the tracks as soon as this tab is opened. Where everybody is on one recording, \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field is the way."
msgstr "L-ebda kelliem għadu magħruf -- jinstabu mill-binarji hekk kif jinfetaħ dan it-tab. Fejn kulħadd ikun fuq reġistrazzjoni waħda, it-triq hija \"diversi kellimin\" fil-qasam Isem il-kelliem."

msgid "The three numbers are primaries, curve and matrix. Different tags need different input colour spaces in Resolve -- otherwise one camera looks unlike the other."
msgstr "It-tliet numri huma l-kuluri primarji, il-kurva u l-matriċi. Tags differenti jeħtieġu spazji tal-kulur tad-dħul differenti f'Resolve -- inkella kamera waħda tidher differenti mill-oħra."

msgid "There are no separate audio recordings. Then the audio of the %s cameras is used -- each becomes a track, and Auphonic removes the bleed."
msgstr "M'hemmx reġistrazzjonijiet tal-awdjo separati. Imbagħad jintuża l-awdjo tal-kameras (%s) -- kull waħda ssir binarju, u Auphonic ineħħi t-tnixxija."

msgid "There is no result yet."
msgstr "Għad m'hemmx riżultat."

msgid "These files are neither audio nor video and stay out:\n\n  %s"
msgstr "Dawn il-fajls la huma awdjo u lanqas vidjo, u jibqgħu barra:\n\n  %s"

msgid "These files do not exist:\n  "
msgstr "Dawn il-fajls ma jeżistux:\n  "

msgid "These files exist already and will be written again:\n\n  %s\n\nIs that intended?"
msgstr "Dawn il-fajls diġà jeżistu u se jerġgħu jinkitbu:\n\n  %s\n\nHekk trid?"

msgid "These files no longer exist:\n  "
msgstr "Dawn il-fajls ma għadhomx jeżistu:\n  "

msgid "These names occur more than once:\n\n  %s\n\nThe recordings are merged into one track and laid end to end by their timecode. That is right if recording was stopped in between."
msgstr "Dawn l-ismijiet jidhru aktar minn darba:\n\n  %s\n\nIr-reġistrazzjonijiet jingħaqdu f'binarju wieħed u jitqiegħdu wara xulxin skont it-timecode tagħhom. Dan huwa korrett jekk ir-reġistrazzjoni twaqqfet fin-nofs."

msgid "These tracks got no file: %s"
msgstr "Dawn il-binarji ma kisbu l-ebda fajl: %s"

msgid "This Resolve project already exists"
msgstr "Dan il-proġett ta' Resolve diġà jeżisti"

msgid "This comes from the recording, not afterwards: the microphones sit too close together or too far from the mouth."
msgstr "Dan ġej mir-reġistrazzjoni, mhux minn wara: il-mikrofoni huma qrib wisq xulxin jew 'il bogħod wisq mill-ħalq."

msgid "This file cannot be played here, and ffplay is missing as a fallback."
msgstr "Dan il-fajl ma jistax jindaqq hawn, u ffplay bħala alternattiva huwa nieqes."

msgid "This is not a project file, and there is none in the same folder.\n\nThe search is for %s*.json -- the script writes it into the output folder at start."
msgstr "Dan mhuwiex fajl tal-proġett, u m'hemm l-ebda wieħed fl-istess folder.\n\nQed jitfittex %s*.json -- l-iskript jiktbu fil-folder tal-ħruġ meta jibda."

msgid "This is what happens next"
msgstr "Dan hu x'jiġri wara"

msgid "This name is on somebody else already. A name is a person, and the cut puts a person on one camera -- please give this voice its own."
msgstr "Dan l-isem diġà ta' xi ħadd ieħor. Isem huwa persuna, u l-muntaġġ ipoġġi persuna fuq kamera waħda -- jekk jogħġbok agħti lil dan il-leħen isem tiegħu."

msgid "This name occurs more than once. The recordings would become one track -- for Multitrack auphonic.com needs at least two different ones."
msgstr "Dan l-isem jidher aktar minn darba. Ir-reġistrazzjonijiet isiru binarju wieħed -- għal Multitrack auphonic.com jeħtieġ mill-inqas tnejn differenti."

msgid "This production already exists"
msgstr "Din il-produzzjoni diġà teżisti"

msgid "This production has no result yet."
msgstr "Din il-produzzjoni għad m'għandhiex riżultat."

msgid "Time limit of %s reached, production still running: %s/engine/status/%s"
msgstr "Intlaħaq il-limitu ta' ħin ta' %s, il-produzzjoni għadha għaddejja: %s/engine/status/%s"

msgid "Timecode %s, the other files are at %s -- this clock was not set."
msgstr "Timecode %s, il-fajls l-oħra huma f'%s -- dan l-arloġġ ma kienx issettjat."

msgid "Timeline %r could not be created."
msgstr "It-Timeline %r ma setgħetx tinħoloq."

msgid "Title at auphonic.com and start of the new file names."
msgstr "It-titlu fuq auphonic.com u l-bidu tal-ismijiet il-ġodda tal-fajls."

msgid "To the In point."
msgstr "Għall-punt tad-dħul."

msgid "To the start."
msgstr "Għall-bidu."

msgid "Too many projects with this name."
msgstr "Wisq proġetti b'dan l-isem."

msgid "Track"
msgstr "Binarju"

msgid "Tracks were added while changing (now %s). That makes the mix\n  wrong. Please delete the tracks without a file at auphonic.com."
msgstr "Żdiedu binarji waqt il-bidla (issa %s). Dan jagħmel it-taħlita\n  ħażina. Jekk jogħġbok ħassar il-binarji mingħajr fajl fuq auphonic.com."

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same file. The second would overwrite the first."
msgstr "Żewġ kameras kienu jipproduċu l-istess fajl. It-tieni kienet tikteb fuq l-ewwel."

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same file: %s"
msgstr "Żewġ kameras kienu jipproduċu l-istess fajl: %s"

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same new file. Please give different names."
msgstr "Żewġ kameras kienu jipproduċu l-istess fajl ġdid. Jekk jogħġbok agħti ismijiet differenti."

msgid "Uneven frame timing cannot be evened out through the audio. If the sample points spread during alignment as well, convert to a fixed frame rate."
msgstr "Il-ħin irregolari tal-oqfsa ma jistax jiġi ugwalizzat permezz tal-awdjo. Jekk il-punti tal-kejl jinxterdu wkoll waqt l-allinjament, ikkonverti għal rata tal-oqfsa fissa."

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Vidjo"

msgid "Video 1"
msgstr "Vidjo 1"

msgid "Video 2"
msgstr "Vidjo 2"

msgid "Video Podcast Magic %s -- raw material becomes an edited podcast"
msgstr "Video Podcast Magic %s -- il-materjal mhux maħdum isir podcast immuntat"

msgid "Volume. 100 is as loud as it goes -- Qt takes nothing above that."
msgstr "Volum. 100 huwa l-ogħla li jista' jkun -- Qt ma jieħu xejn aktar minn hekk."

msgid "%s (%s) -- talking at once counts twice"
msgstr "%s (%s) -- meta jitkellmu flimkien jgħodd darbtejn"

msgid "Wide shot at most"
msgstr "Veduta wiesgħa l-aktar"

msgid "Wide shot at the latest"
msgstr "Veduta wiesgħa l-aktar tard"

msgid "Wide shot for greeting at the start and farewell at the end"
msgstr "Veduta wiesgħa għat-tislima fil-bidu u l-addiju fl-aħħar"

msgid "Without it every player has to guess, and all guess SDR. In Resolve under Deliver > Advanced Settings set the Color space tag and the Gamma tag instead of leaving them at \"Same as Project\"."
msgstr "Mingħajru kull plejer irid jiddevina, u kollha jiddevinaw SDR. F'Resolve taħt Deliver > Advanced Settings issettja Color space tag u Gamma tag minflok tħallihom fuq \"Same as Project\"."

msgid "Without processing at auphonic.com"
msgstr "Mingħajr ipproċessar fuq auphonic.com"

msgid "There is no camera cut yet: it needs two people, each with a name and a camera.\nSeparate recordings give that with the Multitrack tick, and so does \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field of one recording --\nthe voices found there get their camera in the table under the recordings.\nA Resolve project is created anyway -- all cameras at their measured places, ready for Multicam."
msgstr "Għad m'hemmx muntaġġ tal-kameras: hemm bżonn żewġ persuni, kull waħda b'isem u kamera.\nReġistrazzjonijiet separati jagħtu dan bil-marka Multitrack, u hekk ukoll \"diversi kellimin\" fil-qasam Isem il-kelliem ta' reġistrazzjoni waħda --\nl-ilħna misjuba hemm jieħdu l-kamera tagħhom fit-tabella taħt ir-reġistrazzjonijiet.\nProġett f'Resolve jinħoloq xorta waħda -- il-kameras kollha fil-postijiet imkejla tagħhom, lesti għal Multicam."

msgid "Without timecode the position of the files is measured."
msgstr "Mingħajr timecode, il-pożizzjoni tal-fajls titkejjel."

msgid "Works out who speaks when from the tracks themselves -- one microphone per person, level against its own noise floor. Where everybody is on one recording, \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field is the way."
msgstr "Jikkalkula min jitkellem meta mill-binarji nfushom -- mikrofonu wieħed għal kull persuna, il-livell kontra l-ħoss tal-isfond tiegħu stess. Fejn kulħadd ikun fuq reġistrazzjoni waħda, it-triq hija \"diversi kellimin\" fil-qasam Isem il-kelliem."

msgid "YouTube -- turns down only, never up"
msgstr "YouTube -- ibaxxi biss, qatt ma jgħolli"

msgid "a box no longer fits into its parent"
msgstr "kaxxa ma għadhiex tidħol fil-kaxxa ġenitur tagħha"

msgid "after the device change"
msgstr "wara l-bidla tal-apparat"

msgid "auphonic.com does not accept the key: %s"
msgstr "auphonic.com ma jaċċettax iċ-ċavetta: %s"

msgid "average"
msgstr "medja"

msgid "belongs to"
msgstr "jappartjeni lil"

msgid "bleed too indistinct: %s of %s seconds usable, sharpest %s of %s needed"
msgstr "tnixxija mhux ċara biżżejjed: jistgħu jintużaw %s minn %s sekondi, l-aktar ċara %s, meħtieġa %s"

msgid "Midnight"
msgstr "Nofsillejl"

msgid "%s carries a timecode from the other side of midnight -- counted as one night, not as a day apart."
msgstr "Il-fajl %s għandu timecode min-naħa l-oħra ta' nofsillejl -- jingħadd bħala lejl wieħed, mhux bħala ġurnata bogħod."

msgid "A timecode counts from midnight and starts over there. The files are put on one axis before anything is subtracted, otherwise the recording after midnight looks almost a day away from the one before. If these really were recorded on different days, the alignment is wrong and the measured offset is the one to trust."
msgstr "It-timecode jgħodd minn nofsillejl u jerġa' jibda mill-ġdid hemm. Il-fajls jitqiegħdu fuq assi wieħed qabel ma jitnaqqas xi ħaġa -- inkella r-reġistrazzjoni wara nofsillejl tidher kważi ġurnata 'l bogħod minn dik ta' qabilha. Jekk dawn verament ġew irreġistrati f'ġranet differenti, l-allinjament huwa ħażin u l-ispostament imkejjel huwa dak li għandek tafda."

msgid "Channel %d is against the stop: %s times three samples or more in a row, the longest %s (%s ms), the first at %s."
msgstr "Il-kanal %d qed jolqot il-limitu -- sekwenzi ta' tliet kampjuni jew aktar wara xulxin: %s, l-itwal %s (%s ms), l-ewwel f'%s."

msgid "Counted here, sample by sample, at the rate the file was recorded at: a run of three or more samples on the highest value an integer format can hold. One or two are rounding and are not reported. What is cut off there is gone and no processing brings it back -- but the recording is still the recording, and this holds nothing up. Only integer formats are counted. 32 bit float has no stop at full scale, so there is nothing there to count."
msgstr "Magħdud hawn, kampjun b'kampjun, bir-rata li biha ġie rreġistrat il-fajl: sekwenza ta' tliet kampjuni jew aktar fuq l-ogħla valur li format ta' numri sħaħ jista' jżomm. Wieħed jew tnejn huma arrotondar u ma jiġux irrappurtati. Dak li jinqata' hemm jintilef u l-ebda pproċessar ma jġibu lura -- iżda r-reġistrazzjoni tibqa' r-reġistrazzjoni, u dan ma jwaqqaf xejn. Jingħaddu biss formati ta' numri sħaħ. Float ta' 32 bit m'għandux limitu fl-iskala sħiħa, għalhekk m'hemm xejn x'jingħadd hemm."

