msgid "  The speaker separation is not used: %s."
msgstr "  Is-separazzjoni tal-kellimin mhix qed tintuża: %s."

msgid "  %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "  %s: il-qari mhux possibbli: %s"

msgid "%s is not part of this run"
msgstr "%s mhuwiex parti minn dan it-tħaddim"

msgid "%s has no place on the axis"
msgstr "%s m'għandux post fuq l-assi tal-ħin"

msgid "no recording named"
msgstr "l-ebda reġistrazzjoni ma ssemmiet"

msgid "nothing of it falls inside the window"
msgstr "xejn minn dan ma jaqa' fit-tieqa tal-ħin"

msgid "the interface"
msgstr "l-interfaċċja"

msgid "the separation in this run"
msgstr "is-separazzjoni f'dan it-tħaddim"

msgid "Speakers, separated by voice"
msgstr "Kellimin, separati skont il-leħen"

msgid "That produced no cut -- press Start above again."
msgstr "Minn dan ma ħareġ l-ebda muntaġġ -- erġa' agħfas \"Ibda\" hawn fuq."

msgid "\nWITHOUT AUPHONIC.COM"
msgstr "\nMINGĦAJR AUPHONIC.COM"

msgid "  Bleed measured, %s in %s only %s dB quieter -- taken out of the speech detection"
msgstr "  Tnixxija mkejla, %s f'%s biss %s dB inqas qawwi -- imneħħi mis-sejbien tad-diskors"

msgid "  Bleed not separable: %s"
msgstr "  It-tnixxija ma tistax tinfired: %s"

msgid "  No moment found where exactly one person speaks -- the bleed stays in the speech detection."
msgstr "  Ma nstabx mument fejn titkellem eżatt persuna waħda -- it-tnixxija tibqa' fis-sejbien tad-diskors."

msgid "  Nothing was audible in the tracks -- no camera cut from this."
msgstr "  Ma nstema' xejn fil-binarji -- minn dan ma joħroġ l-ebda muntaġġ tal-kameras."

msgid "  Not in the cut: %s -- a separation speaks for the recording, or it was not measured."
msgstr "  Mhux fil-muntaġġ: %s -- separazzjoni titkellem għar-reġistrazzjoni, jew ma tkejlitx."

msgid "  The tracks are used as recorded: aligned, mixed and brought to the\n  target loudness. No de-bleed, no leveler, no noise removal -- for\n  those the run needs auphonic.com."
msgstr "  Il-binarji jintużaw kif ġew irreġistrati: allinjati, imħallta u\n  miġjuba għall-qawwa tal-ħoss mixtieqa. Bla De-Bleed, bla Leveler,\n  bla tneħħija tal-ħsejjes -- għal dawn it-tħaddim jeħtieġ auphonic.com."

msgid "  --without-auphonic and --auphonic-done were both given. The finished tracks win: there is nothing left to send anywhere."
msgstr "  Ingħataw kemm --without-auphonic kif ukoll --auphonic-done. Il-binarji lesti jirbħu: ma fadal xejn x'jintbagħat imkien."

msgid "MULTITRACK NOT POSSIBLE\n  Without an API key there is nothing to send to auphonic.com.\n  With --without-auphonic it runs locally instead: aligned,\n  mixed and cut, but without de-bleed and leveler."
msgstr "MULTITRACK MHUX POSSIBBLI\n  Mingħajr ċavetta tal-API m'hemm xejn x'jintbagħat lil auphonic.com.\n  B'--without-auphonic minflok jaħdem lokalment: allinjat,\n  imħallat u maqtugħ, iżda mingħajr De-Bleed u Leveler."

msgid "  Caution: only %s of %s pairs measurable. For the rest no moment was found where exactly one person speaks, so their bleed stays in -- the speaker detection is unreliable here."
msgstr "  Attenzjoni: %s biss minn %s pari jistgħu jitkejlu. Għall-bqija ma nstabx mument fejn titkellem eżatt persuna waħda, għalhekk it-tnixxija tagħhom tibqa' -- is-sejbien tal-kellimin hawn mhuwiex affidabbli."

msgid "the microphones hear each other almost as loudly as their own speaker"
msgstr "il-mikrofoni jisimgħu lil xulxin kważi daqs il-kelliem tagħhom stess"

msgid "the tracks are too much alike to separate"
msgstr "il-binarji jixxiebhu wisq biex jinfirdu"

msgid "Reading the plan"
msgstr "Qari tal-pjan"

msgid "Audio out of the cameras"
msgstr "Awdjo mill-kameras"

msgid "Common time axis"
msgstr "Assi tal-ħin komuni"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com"
msgstr "Ipproċessar fuq auphonic.com"

msgid "Loudness"
msgstr "Qawwa tal-ħoss"

msgid "Loudness and levels"
msgstr "Qawwa tal-ħoss u livelli"

msgid "Loudness of the finished episode"
msgstr "Qawwa tal-ħoss tal-episodju lest"

msgid "How loud the finished episode is made. The same gain goes on every\ntrack, so the balance between the speakers is kept.\n\"Take from source files\" adjusts nothing at all: auphonic.com goes\non doing what its preset says, and without auphonic.com the sound\nstays as it is in the source files."
msgstr "Kemm isir qawwi l-episodju lest. L-istess amplifikazzjoni tmur fuq kull\nbinarju, hekk il-bilanċ bejn il-kellimin jinżamm.\n\"Mill-fajls tas-sors\" ma jaġġusta xejn: auphonic.com ikompli\njagħmel dak li jgħid il-preset tiegħu, u mingħajr auphonic.com il-ħoss\njibqa' kif inhu fil-fajls tas-sors."

msgid "    Loudness was not adjusted -- the target below is only what the meter\n    measures against."
msgstr "    Il-qawwa tal-ħoss ma ġietx aġġustata -- il-mira hawn taħt hija biss dak\n    li l-miter ikejjel kontrih."

msgid "Who speaks when"
msgstr "Min jitkellem meta"

msgid "Writing the camera files"
msgstr "Kitba tal-fajls tal-kameras"

msgid "Handover and result"
msgstr "Konsenja u riżultat"

msgid "Show twice as much (minus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "Juri d-doppju (it-tast minus, jew ir-rota fuq l-istrixxa)"

msgid "Show half as much, around the current position (plus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "Juri n-nofs, madwar il-pożizzjoni attwali (it-tast plus, jew ir-rota fuq l-istrixxa)"

msgid "The whole length again (0 key)"
msgstr "It-tul kollu mill-ġdid (it-tast 0)"

msgid "  Also fetched: %s"
msgstr "  Tniżżel ukoll: %s"

msgid "Auphonic will not take the settings: %s"
msgstr "Auphonic ma jaċċettax l-issettjar: %s"

msgid "      %s channels"
msgstr "      Kanali: %s"

msgid "measurement running ..."
msgstr "kejl għaddej ..."

msgid "      Channel %d"
msgstr "      Kanal %d"

msgid "Looking at the channels"
msgstr "Eżami tal-kanali"

msgid "channels not readable: %s"
msgstr "il-kanali ma jistgħux jinqraw: %s"

msgid "unused input -- ignored"
msgstr "dħul mhux użat -- injorat"

msgid "uncertain -- %s"
msgstr "inċert -- %s"

msgid "set by hand -- overrides the measurement"
msgstr "issettjat bl-idejn -- jegħleb il-kejl"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Lingwa"

msgid "both channels identical -- mono laid on both sides"
msgstr "iż-żewġ kanali identiċi -- mono mqiegħed fuq iż-żewġ naħat"

msgid "probably two microphones -- about %s m apart%s"
msgstr "probabbilment żewġ mikrofoni -- madwar %s m bogħod minn xulxin%s"

msgid ", agreed at %s of %s places"
msgstr ", jaqblu f'%s minn %s postijiet"

msgid "probably one stereo track -- both microphones in the same place"
msgstr "probabbilment binarju stereo wieħed -- iż-żewġ mikrofoni fl-istess post"

msgid "not recognisable -- only %s of %s places where both channels carry sound, %s needed"
msgstr "ma jintgħarafx -- %s biss minn %s postijiet fejn iż-żewġ kanali għandhom ħoss, meħtieġa %s"

msgid "not recognisable -- these two agree no better than each does with the channel beside it"
msgstr "ma jintgħarafx -- dawn it-tnejn ma jaqblux aħjar milli jaqbel kull wieħed mal-kanal ta' ħdejh"

msgid "not set"
msgstr "mhux issettjat"

msgid "The language spoken in the recording. It becomes the tag of the\nwritten audio track, and the recognition here is told to expect it.\nPreset from the system language. \"%s\" leaves the track untagged\nand lets the recognition work the language out itself."
msgstr "Il-lingwa mitkellma fir-reġistrazzjoni. Issir it-tikketta\ntal-binarju tal-awdjo miktub, u r-rikonoxximent hawn jiġi mgħarraf biex jistennieha.\nIssettjata minn qabel mil-lingwa tas-sistema. \"%s\" iħalli l-binarju bla tikketta\nu jħalli lir-rikonoxximent isib il-lingwa waħdu."

