msgid "Cutting out track %d of %d"
msgstr "Qtugħ tal-binarju %d minn %d"

msgid "cutting failed: %s"
msgstr "il-qtugħ falla: %s"

msgid "  One camera for everybody: cut into %s shots at the change of speaker, so Resolve can group them."
msgstr "  Kamera waħda għal kulħadd: maqtugħa fejn jinbidel il-kelliem, f'qatgħat (%s), biex Resolve ikun jista' jiġborhom."

msgid "Shorter shots fall into the following one."
msgstr "Qatgħat iqsar jingħaqdu ma' dik ta' wara."

msgid "Speaks at least"
msgstr "Jitkellem mill-inqas"

msgid "below this the camera does not follow"
msgstr "taħt dan il-kamera ma ssegwix"

msgid "A short \"yes\" does not move the picture. Without this a block of half a second draws the camera over, and the minimum edit duration then holds it there for seconds."
msgstr "\"Iva\" qasira ma ċċaqlaqx l-istampa. Mingħajr dan, blokk ta' nofs sekonda jiġbed il-kamera lejh, u t-tul minimu tal-qatgħa mbagħad iżommha hemm għal sekondi."

msgid "Answer on screen earlier"
msgstr "Tweġiba fuq l-iskrin qabel"

msgid "before the question ends"
msgstr "qabel ma tispiċċa l-mistoqsija"

msgid "Zero is where the asker stops, not where the answer starts: the pause between them belongs to the question. Applies only where \"After a question\" asks for it, and the Edit Change Delay is not added again."
msgstr "Iż-żero huwa fejn min jistaqsi jieqaf, mhux fejn tibda t-tweġiba: il-pawża bejniethom tappartjeni lill-mistoqsija. Japplika biss fejn \"Wara mistoqsija\" jitolbu, u l-Edit Change Delay ma jiżdiedx mill-ġdid."

msgid "Wide shot at least"
msgstr "Veduta wiesgħa mill-inqas"

msgid "so long the inserted wide shot stands at least"
msgstr "mill-inqas daqshekk iddum il-veduta wiesgħa mdaħħla"

msgid "It then runs to the end of the sentence. Below five seconds the look reads as a twitch."
msgstr "Imbagħad tibqa' sat-tmiem tas-sentenza. Taħt ħames sekondi l-ħarsa tidher qisha skoss."

msgid "and at most this long"
msgstr "u l-aktar daqshekk"

msgid "Where the end of the sentence lies beyond it, the last clause break before it ends the shot -- it is not cut off mid-sentence."
msgstr "Fejn it-tmiem tas-sentenza jkun lil hinn minn hekk, l-aħħar waqfa bejn partijiet tas-sentenza qabel dan ittemm il-qatgħa -- ma tinqatax f'nofs sentenza."

msgid "Long monologue"
msgstr "Monologu twil"

msgid "one person holds the floor past \"Wide shot after\""
msgstr "persuna waħda titkellem aktar minn \"Veduta wiesgħa wara\""

msgid "\"Alternating\" remembers what the last break of this monologue showed. The listener only gets the picture when someone on that camera was heard in the last 20 seconds; otherwise the wide shot."
msgstr "\"Alternat\" jiftakar x'uriet l-aħħar waqfa ta' dan il-monologu. Min jisma' jieħu l-istampa biss meta xi ħadd fuq dik il-kamera nstema' fl-aħħar 20 sekonda; inkella l-veduta wiesgħa."

msgid "Several speak at once"
msgstr "Diversi jitkellmu flimkien"

msgid "and no camera shows exactly them"
msgstr "u l-ebda kamera ma turihom eżatt"

msgid "Cutting into a jumble looks frantic."
msgstr "Il-qtugħ f'taħwida jidher frenetiku."

msgid "Nobody speaks"
msgstr "Ħadd ma jitkellem"

msgid "no voice is heard at all here"
msgstr "hawn ma jinstema' l-ebda leħen"

msgid "A breath in the middle of a sentence and the end of a thought are both silence, and the program cannot tell them apart. Only the length can: \"Short gap up to\" says how long a silence may be and still count as a breath."
msgstr "Nifs f'nofs sentenza u t-tmiem ta' ħsieb it-tnejn huma silenzju, u l-programm ma jistax jagħżel bejniethom. It-tul biss jista': \"Pawża qasira sa\" jgħid kemm jista' jkun twil silenzju u xorta jgħodd bħala nifs."

msgid "Short gap up to"
msgstr "Pawża qasira sa"

msgid "so long a silence leaves the picture alone"
msgstr "daqshekk silenzju jħalli l-istampa kif inhi"

msgid "Only where \"Nobody speaks\" is set to hold a short gap. A gap up to this long changes nothing, a longer one goes to the wide shot. Above two seconds the picture begins to stand on someone silent for over five seconds."
msgstr "Biss fejn \"Ħadd ma jitkellem\" huwa ssettjat biex iżomm pawża qasira. Pawża sa dan it-tul ma tbiddel xejn, waħda itwal tmur għall-veduta wiesgħa. 'Il fuq minn żewġ sekondi l-istampa tibda toqgħod fuq xi ħadd sieket għal aktar minn ħames sekondi."

msgid "Recognition uncertain"
msgstr "Għarfien inċert"

msgid "the speaker recognition frays or leaves a heap behind"
msgstr "l-għarfien tal-kellimin jitqatta' jew iħalli borġ warajh"

msgid "Guessing puts the wrong person on screen for seconds; the wide shot is right in every case. Somebody is speaking here -- where nobody is, \"Nobody speaks\" decides."
msgstr "Deċiżjoni bl-addoċċ turi l-persuna l-ħażina fuq l-iskrin għal sekondi; il-veduta wiesgħa hija tajba f'kull każ. Hawn xi ħadd qed jitkellem -- fejn ħadd ma jitkellem, jiddeċiedi \"Ħadd ma jitkellem\"."

msgid "the picture goes to the answer before it starts"
msgstr "l-istampa tmur għat-tweġiba qabel ma tibda"

msgid "Only after a question that is not the main speaker's, when somebody else takes over at once and keeps the floor.\n\"do not go early\" means no early camera change: the picture follows the sound here as it does everywhere else."
msgstr "Biss wara mistoqsija li mhix tal-kelliem ewlieni, meta xi ħadd ieħor jieħu l-kelma minnufih u jżommha.\n\"tgħaġġilx\" tfisser l-ebda bidla ta' kamera kmieni: l-istampa ssegwi l-ħoss hawn bħal kullimkien ieħor."

msgid "Wide shot"
msgstr "Veduta wiesgħa"

msgid "Wide shot %d"
msgstr "Veduta wiesgħa %d"

msgid "(wide shot)"
msgstr "(veduta wiesgħa)"

msgid "No speaker"
msgstr "L-ebda kelliem"

msgid "Listener"
msgstr "Min jisma'"

msgid "Alternating"
msgstr "Alternat"

msgid "No camera change"
msgstr "L-ebda bidla ta' kamera"

msgid "Hold a short gap"
msgstr "Żomm pawża qasira"

msgid "do not go early"
msgstr "tgħaġġilx"

msgid "Answering speaker"
msgstr "Min iwieġeb"

msgid "  %sx away from the speaker because a shot ran longer than %s s"
msgstr "  %sx 'il bogħod mill-kelliem għax qatgħa damet aktar minn %s s"

msgid "%s is in place."
msgstr "Il-verżjoni %s qiegħda f'postha."

msgid "This window is still the version it started as. It can start again now and come up as that one, or you can do that yourself later."
msgstr "Din it-tieqa għadha l-verżjoni li bdiet biha. Tista' terġa' tibda issa u titla' b'dik il-verżjoni, jew tista' tagħmel dan int aktar tard."

msgid "This copy runs out of a folder of its own, so pip has nothing here to update. This installs it: %s"
msgstr "Din il-kopja taħdem minn folder tagħha, għalhekk pip m'għandu xejn x'jaġġorna hawn. Dan jinstallaha: %s"

msgid "Language of the window"
msgstr "Lingwa tat-tieqa"

msgid "A language chosen here is spoken from the next start."
msgstr "Lingwa magħżula hawn tintuża mill-bidu li jmiss."

msgid "Restart the application"
msgstr "Erġa' ibda l-applikazzjoni"

msgid "The work can be written to a project file first."
msgstr "Ix-xogħol jista' jinkiteb l-ewwel f'fajl tal-proġett."

msgid "Starting the application again brings it at once, and asks first what is to happen to the work. Leaving it alone costs nothing -- it comes at the next start."
msgstr "Jekk terġa' tibda l-applikazzjoni, il-lingwa tidħol mill-ewwel, u l-applikazzjoni l-ewwel tistaqsi x'għandu jsir mix-xogħol. Jekk tħalliha kif inhi, ma titlef xejn -- il-lingwa tidħol fil-bidu li jmiss."

msgid "The application is about to start again. Shall the work be written to a project file first?"
msgstr "L-applikazzjoni se terġa' tibda. Ix-xogħol għandu jinkiteb l-ewwel f'fajl tal-proġett?"

msgid "Written, the new window opens the project again and everything stands where it stood. Not written, it comes up empty and the files have to be added afresh."
msgstr "Jekk jinkiteb, it-tieqa l-ġdida terġa' tiftaħ il-proġett u kollox jibqa' fejn kien. Jekk ma jinkitibx, titla' vojta u l-fajls iridu jiżdiedu mill-ġdid."

msgid "Save and restart"
msgstr "Issejvja u erġa' ibda"

msgid "Restart without saving"
msgstr "Erġa' ibda mingħajr ma tissejvja"

msgid "The run is still going. The window can be started again once it is finished."
msgstr "It-tħaddim għadu għaddej. It-tieqa tista' terġa' tinbeda ladarba jispiċċa."

msgid "System language (%s)"
msgstr "Lingwa tas-sistema (%s)"

msgid "A shortcut to this program was made: %s"
msgstr "Inħoloq shortcut għal dan il-programm: %s"

msgid "No shortcut to this program was made: %s"
msgstr "Ma nħoloqx shortcut għal dan il-programm: %s"

msgid "it was written and was not there afterwards"
msgstr "inkiteb u wara ma kienx hemm"

msgid "This program is running as %s and the packages installed for it are %s, so none of them can be loaded. This starts it right: %s"
msgstr "Dan il-programm qed jaħdem bħala %s u l-pakketti installati għalih huma %s, għalhekk l-ebda wieħed minnhom ma jista' jitgħabba. Dan jibdih sew: %s"

msgid "This handover carries no frame rate, so the timeline cannot be built from it. Please make the run again."
msgstr "Din il-konsenja ma fihiex rata tal-oqfsa, għalhekk it-Timeline ma tistax tinbena minnha. Jekk jogħġbok erġa' agħmel it-tħaddim."

msgid "Cut by speaker"
msgstr "Muntaġġ skont il-kelliem"

msgid "Sync only"
msgstr "Sinkronizzazzjoni biss"

msgid "Project type"
msgstr "Tip ta' proġett"

msgid "No project type chosen yet."
msgstr "L-ebda tip ta' proġett għadu ma ntgħażel."

msgid "What is this production to become?"
msgstr "X'għandha ssir din il-produzzjoni?"

msgid "\"%s\": the cameras on one time axis and a cut by who is speaking.\n\"%s\": the cameras on one time axis, nothing more -- no speakers, no cut."
msgstr "\"%s\": il-kameras fuq assi tal-ħin wieħed u muntaġġ skont min qed jitkellem.\n\"%s\": il-kameras fuq assi tal-ħin wieħed, xejn aktar -- l-ebda kelliem, l-ebda muntaġġ."

msgid "Sync only: no cut. The handover carries the multicam timeline alone; the Resolve project is created from the Output tab."
msgstr "Sinkronizzazzjoni biss: l-ebda muntaġġ. Il-konsenja fiha biss it-Timeline multicam; il-proġett ta' Resolve jinħoloq mit-tab \"Ħruġ\"."

msgid "Project type: Sync only -- no speakers, no transcript, no cut; the handover carries the multicam timeline alone."
msgstr "Tip ta' proġett: Sinkronizzazzjoni biss -- l-ebda kelliem, l-ebda traskrizzjoni, l-ebda muntaġġ; il-konsenja fiha biss it-Timeline multicam."

msgid "\n  Sync only: no cut by speaker was asked for.\n  Only the Timeline for the multicam clip is built."
msgstr "\n  Sinkronizzazzjoni biss: ma ntalab l-ebda muntaġġ skont il-kelliem.\n  Tinbena biss it-Timeline għall-klipp multicam."

msgid "  %s video tracks, named after the camera files:"
msgstr "  Binarji tal-vidjo: %s, bl-ismijiet tal-fajls tal-kameras:"

msgid "Sync only takes one audio recording; this is one more: %s"
msgstr "Sinkronizzazzjoni biss tieħu reġistrazzjoni tal-awdjo waħda; din hija oħra: %s"

msgid "Sync only: the handover is worked out again; there is no cut to redo. Resolve must be running."
msgstr "Sinkronizzazzjoni biss: il-konsenja terġa' tinħadem; m'hemmx muntaġġ x'jerġa' jsir. Resolve irid ikun qed jaħdem."

msgid "%s has not started yet"
msgstr "%s għadu ma bediex"

msgid "%s   --   the sound cannot be played"
msgstr "%s   --   il-ħoss ma jistax jindaqq"

msgid "sound placed by clock -- measurement pending"
msgstr "ħoss imqiegħed skont l-arloġġ -- il-kejl għadu pendenti"

msgid "\nSPEAKER LEVELS"
msgstr "\nLIVELLI TAL-KELLIMIN"

msgid "Measuring %s"
msgstr "Kejl ta' %s"

msgid "  %-20s not measurable -- left as it is"
msgstr "  %-20s ma jistax jitkejjel -- jitħalla kif inhu"

msgid "  %-20s %s LUFS -- nothing on it, left as it is"
msgstr "  %-20s %s LUFS -- xejn fuqu, jitħalla kif inhu"

msgid "  %-20s %s LUFS  ->  %s dB"
msgstr "  %-20s %s LUFS  ->  %s dB"

msgid "  Only one voice -- nothing to match it against."
msgstr "  Leħen wieħed biss -- m'hemm xejn x'tqabblu miegħu."

msgid "  Common level:      %s LUFS, the median of the voices"
msgstr "  Livell komuni:     %s LUFS, il-medjan tal-ilħna"

msgid "--new-name names %s, which is not one of the camera files of this run."
msgstr "--new-name isemmi %s, li mhuwiex wieħed mill-fajls tal-kameras ta' dan it-tħaddim."

